cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Se usar o ReperIO em um trabalho, cite-o assim. / If you use ReperIO, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ReperIO: busca, índice, exportação e cópia de arquivos em servidores"
abstract: >-
  Portable, dependency-free desktop tool for Windows and Linux that searches local folders and network
  file servers (SMB/CIFS, DFS, mapped drives) for files by name and extension, keeps a local SQLite index
  for instant repeated searches, exports results to Excel, CSV or TXT and copies files in parallel. It
  stays responsive on unreliable servers by using several independent SMB connections, switching
  connection when one stalls and reading problematic folders in quarantine.
authors:
